; FS_USE_TRANS labels each new tmpfs root using its saved creator SID before
; the stock executor reopens it. O_RDONLY|O_DIRECTORY requires both open and
; read. Ordinary child creation instead uses the parent inode label, and this
; temporary root cannot accept children or be assigned to an existing inode.
